WEBVTT

01:42.960 --> 01:43.920
I made the wine

01:44.000 --> 01:45.360
- Watch it!
- I sell myself.

01:46.000 --> 01:48.520
- Just look at this one…
- Which is most suitable as medicinal wine?

01:49.720 --> 01:51.360
You should buy that at the pharmacy.

01:52.520 --> 01:54.720
The lady who uses poison
was attacked in my residence.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.960
- Inform all the secret guards.
- Yes.

01:57.040 --> 01:57.880
Hurry.

02:45.480 --> 02:46.720
How dare you show up?

03:00.760 --> 03:02.240
DUKE SU'S MANSION

03:11.080 --> 03:14.160
RETURN OF THE CLOUDS

03:14.240 --> 03:15.240
Shijie,

03:16.840 --> 03:17.680
how are you doing?

03:18.160 --> 03:19.400
What exactly happened?

03:19.480 --> 03:21.120
I don't know what happened either.

03:21.200 --> 03:22.240
A lady named Jiuyue

03:22.320 --> 03:24.440
and a guard of Duke Su
suddenly came to my residence,

03:24.520 --> 03:26.120
claiming they'd treat
Magistrate Xue's illness.

03:26.200 --> 03:28.600
Later on,
assassins appeared out of nowhere,

03:28.680 --> 03:29.920
attempting to kill that lady.

03:30.480 --> 03:31.880
Everything happened too suddenly.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.200
How is Magistrate Xue?

03:33.280 --> 03:34.480
We brought him here.

03:34.560 --> 03:36.160
Duke Su said it isn't safe recently,

03:36.920 --> 03:38.280
so he'll be staying here for now.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.600
Are they hurt?

03:41.680 --> 03:42.760
What about you?

03:42.840 --> 03:43.760
Are you all right?

03:44.560 --> 03:45.400
I'm fine,

03:46.160 --> 03:47.600
but that lady named Jiuyue

03:48.280 --> 03:49.400
seems to be injured severely.

03:49.480 --> 03:50.400
I'll check on her first.

03:59.720 --> 04:00.640
Duke Su,

04:02.640 --> 04:03.640
are you hurt?

04:03.720 --> 04:04.840
I'm fine.

04:07.560 --> 04:08.880
- How is Jiuyue?
- How is Jiuyue?

04:08.960 --> 04:10.320
She's out of danger

04:10.400 --> 04:11.320
and is still unconscious.

04:11.400 --> 04:12.840
She'll be fine
after resting for a few days.

04:30.320 --> 04:32.000
Jiuyue is the princess of Great Zhao.

04:32.080 --> 04:33.680
Great Zhao's delegation is arriving soon.

04:33.760 --> 04:36.640
She is the key figure
in our alliance meeting with Zhao.

04:36.720 --> 04:38.240
Everyone has set their sights on her.

04:38.320 --> 04:40.760
That's why I need to make sure she's safe.

04:41.520 --> 04:42.840
So,

04:42.920 --> 04:45.040
someone doesn't want Great Zhao
to have an alliance meeting with us.

04:45.120 --> 04:46.000
Yes.

04:48.240 --> 04:51.480
When Jiuyue was treating Magistrate Xue,

04:52.040 --> 04:53.600
others got the chance to take action.

04:54.320 --> 04:56.040
Before she fully recovers,

04:56.120 --> 04:57.320
I won't feel at ease.

04:57.880 --> 04:58.760
When she gets better,

04:58.840 --> 04:59.880
I'll visit her every day.

04:59.960 --> 05:01.760
- Really?
- What?

05:01.840 --> 05:02.840
You said

05:03.600 --> 05:05.040
you'll visit my place every day.

05:11.400 --> 05:12.240
Wait a minute.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.560
What are these?

05:13.640 --> 05:14.800
- Some clothes.
- Come here.

05:15.480 --> 05:16.360
Next.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.280
Go.

05:17.840 --> 05:18.840
Go.

05:20.480 --> 05:22.840
- Did you see anyone suspicious?
- No.

05:22.920 --> 05:24.640
- We didn't.
- Are you sure?

05:24.720 --> 05:25.720
Look up.

05:27.000 --> 05:29.080
- Did you see anyone suspicious?
- No.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.640
- What about you?
- No.

05:31.280 --> 05:33.080
Did you see this person, around this tall?

05:33.160 --> 05:34.560
- No.
- Think again.

05:35.960 --> 05:37.120
- I really didn't.
- My lord,

05:37.200 --> 05:38.920
we have people monitoring every spot.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.200
We have yet to find Chu Lan.

05:41.960 --> 05:43.080
Continue to patrol around.

05:43.160 --> 05:44.520
The city is heavily guarded.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.760
He won't be able to escape.

05:45.840 --> 05:47.480
With the Eldest Princess still grounded,

05:47.960 --> 05:49.680
it seems the only
hiding place left for him

05:49.760 --> 05:50.720
is Li Residence.

05:50.800 --> 05:53.280
He certainly won't be foolish enough
to hide him at home.

05:54.360 --> 05:56.160
We only need to send a warning
to our opponent.

05:56.640 --> 05:57.480
Yes.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.640
Where is Du Shi?

06:10.200 --> 06:11.120
Isn't he here yet?

06:13.240 --> 06:14.120
Mr. Shen,

06:14.680 --> 06:16.720
Mr. Du's grandmother
in Wuzhou has fallen ill.

06:16.800 --> 06:18.120
He rushed back last night.

06:18.200 --> 06:20.080
Before leaving, he wrote a letter about it

06:20.160 --> 06:21.320
and asked me to give it to you.

06:25.400 --> 06:27.080
Since the people I appointed are useless,

06:27.800 --> 06:29.280
I'll take volunteers.

06:29.360 --> 06:32.520
Who among you is willing
to join Ms. Jiang Li

06:33.320 --> 06:34.640
in impressing His Majesty?

06:41.480 --> 06:42.680
Go.

06:42.760 --> 06:43.760
I don't want to do it.

06:43.840 --> 06:44.760
You do it.

06:45.520 --> 06:46.800
Before going home today,

06:47.360 --> 06:48.480
if no one volunteers,

06:49.040 --> 06:50.560
I'll nominate
based on talent and knowledge.

06:51.520 --> 06:52.480
- Well…
- Well…

06:52.560 --> 06:54.040
Based on talent and knowledge…

06:55.440 --> 06:56.840
I don't think we'd be selected.

06:59.760 --> 07:00.960
Why are you looking at me?

07:02.760 --> 07:04.800
Whoever wants to go can go.

07:04.880 --> 07:05.800
I'm not going anyway.

07:05.880 --> 07:08.280
Mr. Du got so scared
that he escaped the capital.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.200
Except for Mr. Zhao,

07:09.720 --> 07:12.040
our talent and knowledge aren't up to par.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.320
When it comes to talent and knowledge,

07:15.400 --> 07:16.440
I'm not good enough either.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.120
Who is Jiang Li?

07:18.200 --> 07:19.440
An Annual Exam first placer.

07:19.520 --> 07:21.600
A heroine who dares to lead people
to petition to His Majesty.

07:21.680 --> 07:23.160
With her talent, knowledge, and courage,

07:23.240 --> 07:24.920
only Mr. Shen is worthy of her

07:25.000 --> 07:26.640
in the entire Hanlin Academy.

07:26.720 --> 07:27.560
Yes.

07:27.640 --> 07:29.360
Why won't Mr. Shen participate?

07:29.440 --> 07:31.720
He knows we dare not
perform with Jiang Li.

07:32.800 --> 07:34.040
Could it be…

07:34.120 --> 07:36.480
- Could it be…
- Could it be…

07:39.960 --> 07:41.080
Didn't you hear?

07:41.160 --> 07:43.600
Jiang Li looks exactly like

07:43.680 --> 07:45.160
Mr. Shen's late wife.

07:48.240 --> 07:51.280
Is Mr. Shen afraid
of falling in love with Jiang Li?

07:51.360 --> 07:53.360
Perhaps he has fallen for her already.

07:53.440 --> 07:54.480
If he has nothing to hide,

07:54.560 --> 07:56.160
why does he need to stay away from her?

07:56.240 --> 07:57.680
That makes sense.

07:57.760 --> 08:00.000
- Yes.
- That's right.

08:00.080 --> 08:01.440
What are you talking about?

08:01.920 --> 08:02.880
Well…

08:05.720 --> 08:07.240
- The food is delicious. Eat up.
- Yes.

08:07.320 --> 08:08.360
Hurry and eat.

08:08.440 --> 08:09.520
- This is delicious.
- Have more.

08:09.600 --> 08:10.720
- Try mine.
- Try this.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.440
Delicious.

08:12.520 --> 08:13.880
This is good.

08:14.440 --> 08:16.120
- Delicious. So good.
- Try this.

08:21.080 --> 08:22.440
How ridiculous.

08:35.760 --> 08:38.159
These are my favorites.

08:38.919 --> 08:39.880
You're bribing me?

08:41.440 --> 08:43.600
You prepared all this.

08:44.400 --> 08:46.640
What kind of hard and tiring work
do you want me to do?

08:46.720 --> 08:48.160
It isn't hard or tiring.

08:48.240 --> 08:50.080
It just requires some acting skills.

08:51.160 --> 08:52.000
What kind of act?

08:52.080 --> 08:54.160
To perform at the alliance meeting

08:54.240 --> 08:55.680
and bring glory to the Jiang family,

08:55.760 --> 08:57.040
I've put in a lot of effort.

08:57.920 --> 08:59.640
Tomorrow is the time to wrap things up.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.560
Wrap things up?

09:01.280 --> 09:04.160
I'll tell Mr. Shen about quitting
and back out from reception duties.

09:04.240 --> 09:05.160
You're performing

09:05.240 --> 09:06.440
and quitting?

09:06.520 --> 09:08.560
This is confusing.

09:08.640 --> 09:11.000
This is called
retreating in order to advance.

09:11.080 --> 09:12.880
If I back out,

09:12.960 --> 09:15.640
Mr. Shen will ask someone
from the Jiang family about the situation.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.160
He might even serve as a mediator.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.240
That person from the Jiang family is me?

09:20.440 --> 09:21.440
And then?

09:21.520 --> 09:24.120
Use your eloquence

09:24.200 --> 09:26.480
to make him come
to the Jiang Residence to see me.

09:28.600 --> 09:30.160
- That's it?
- Yes.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.920
So, actually,

09:32.000 --> 09:34.120
you're asking me to act as myself?

09:34.200 --> 09:35.400
Don't think that Mr. Shen

09:35.480 --> 09:37.800
will come to Jiang Residence
just because you want him to.

09:37.880 --> 09:38.760
Jiang Li.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.200
I have to admire your insight.

09:41.280 --> 09:44.240
If you ask Liu Xu or Ye Shijie for help,

09:44.320 --> 09:46.280
they will surely fail to do it.

09:46.360 --> 09:48.080
But you came to me.

09:48.160 --> 09:49.240
It's as if the heavens

09:49.320 --> 09:51.600
opened a new path for you.

09:51.680 --> 09:54.000
It seems like the heavens
is kind to you as well.

09:54.080 --> 09:56.360
How dare you say that
and not get struck by lightning?

09:58.160 --> 10:00.280
But I've thought it over.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.520
Why would someone like Duke Su

10:02.600 --> 10:04.320
love watching you put on an act?

10:06.840 --> 10:09.400
Your idea is to head east,

10:09.480 --> 10:11.840
but you tell everyone you're heading west.

10:12.400 --> 10:15.160
Even though your stories
are poorly written,

10:15.240 --> 10:18.720
they somehow make people
want to keep reading.

10:19.680 --> 10:22.400
I want to know what your idea
of heading east is.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.840
Is this what they call

10:24.720 --> 10:25.560
suspense?

10:25.640 --> 10:27.200
You see through it but remain silent.

10:27.280 --> 10:28.680
You'll get more delicious food
in the future.

10:30.280 --> 10:31.200
All right.

10:32.040 --> 10:33.360
HANLIN ACADEMY

10:41.160 --> 10:42.080
He really came.

10:49.280 --> 10:50.360
- Mr. Shen.
- Mr. Shen.

10:52.120 --> 10:52.960
Mr. Shen,

10:53.040 --> 10:53.960
what brings you here?

10:54.040 --> 10:55.800
I came to see
how the preparations are going.

10:56.520 --> 10:57.680
It is a crucial time now.

10:58.280 --> 10:59.720
Everyone needs to stay on high alert.

10:59.800 --> 11:00.640
Don't slack off.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.240
If there is any difficulty,

11:02.320 --> 11:04.280
please let me know in advance.

11:04.360 --> 11:06.400
- Yes.
- Yes.

11:06.480 --> 11:08.040
Is anyone absent today?

11:08.120 --> 11:09.200
Shijie isn't here.

11:09.280 --> 11:10.640
He went to the palace
on official business.

11:10.720 --> 11:11.680
Shijie told me.

11:12.680 --> 11:15.160
Everyone has been arriving early
and leaving late recently

11:15.240 --> 11:16.120
without taking any leave.

11:16.200 --> 11:17.440
Such dedication and effort

11:17.520 --> 11:18.440
deserve praise.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.680
- Thank you, Mr. Shen.
- Thank you, Mr. Shen.

11:20.760 --> 11:21.760
You may get back to work.

11:30.280 --> 11:31.640
Hey, what should I do?

11:31.720 --> 11:32.600
- Goodness.
- I…

11:37.680 --> 11:38.520
Jingrui.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.680
You are close to Liu Xu and Jiang Li.

11:43.760 --> 11:46.560
Do you know about her quitting?

11:46.640 --> 11:47.480
Yes.

11:47.560 --> 11:48.600
What happened?

11:52.400 --> 11:55.280
Should we talk in private?

11:56.000 --> 11:59.240
It's because of the collaborative
performance with Hanlin scholars.

12:00.120 --> 12:01.680
No one wanted to perform with her,

12:02.640 --> 12:03.480
so she fell ill.

12:03.560 --> 12:05.240
That's open for discussion.

12:05.320 --> 12:06.560
She fell ill because of this?

12:06.640 --> 12:09.360
Do you know what people
are saying about Jiang Li?

12:09.440 --> 12:10.720
They say

12:10.800 --> 12:12.840
she looks just like your late wife,

12:12.920 --> 12:15.000
so she's trying hard to get close to you.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.680
So to avoid arousing suspicion,

12:16.760 --> 12:17.840
you're avoiding her.

12:17.920 --> 12:18.960
Who said that?

12:19.040 --> 12:19.920
That's nonsense!

12:20.000 --> 12:22.360
Mr. Shen, your reputation
is well-established, so you're not afraid.

12:22.440 --> 12:23.280
But for a young lady

12:23.360 --> 12:25.320
who is not yet married,

12:25.400 --> 12:27.040
such rumors can be as sharp as a knife.

12:27.120 --> 12:29.320
If I were Jiang Li, I'd rather just die.

12:30.880 --> 12:33.480
As her family and friend,

12:33.560 --> 12:34.760
you should advise her

12:35.440 --> 12:37.240
to not pay attention
to this filthy gossip.

12:37.320 --> 12:38.680
You've overestimated me.

12:39.160 --> 12:40.640
I wouldn't know how to advise a lady.

12:41.400 --> 12:42.440
I'm at a loss too.

12:42.520 --> 12:44.520
Otherwise, I wouldn't be anxious here.

12:44.600 --> 12:46.400
If the delegation's reception is delayed,

12:46.920 --> 12:50.160
the blame will fall on the Jiang family.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.600
What should we do then?

12:52.080 --> 12:53.440
Uncle Yuanbai is still traveling.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.200
Aunt Ji isn't in her right mind,

12:55.280 --> 12:56.600
and Grandmother is elderly.

12:56.680 --> 12:58.720
No one in our family can persuade her.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.200
However,

13:03.520 --> 13:06.840
I often hear Jiang Li
speak highly of you, Mr. Shen.

13:06.920 --> 13:10.200
Perhaps you could help
talk some sense into her?

13:10.280 --> 13:11.160
Yes.

13:15.280 --> 13:16.560
Mr. Shen,

13:16.640 --> 13:19.320
whoever started the trouble should end it.

13:32.680 --> 13:33.840
Ms. Jiang Li is in a bad mood.

13:33.920 --> 13:34.800
She doesn't want to see anyone.

13:34.880 --> 13:36.440
I know she's annoyed at me.

13:36.920 --> 13:38.400
I won't go in. I won't.

13:39.360 --> 13:40.240
Baixue,

13:41.440 --> 13:42.640
please bring Mr. Shen in.

13:44.920 --> 13:45.760
This…

13:47.680 --> 13:48.720
might be inappropriate.

13:48.800 --> 13:49.680
Mr. Shen,

13:51.440 --> 13:52.520
saving a life

13:52.600 --> 13:54.360
is of boundless beneficence.

13:55.160 --> 13:56.000
As her cousin,

13:56.080 --> 13:56.920
I really…

14:00.040 --> 14:01.480
need you to help her.

14:11.520 --> 14:13.640
FANGFEI COURTYARD

14:31.680 --> 14:32.520
Mr. Shen.

14:35.760 --> 14:36.640
Have a seat.

14:44.760 --> 14:47.000
I've heard from your cousin
about the rumors.

14:47.520 --> 14:49.360
I will investigate
and find out who started them.

14:49.440 --> 14:51.320
It's just that the Zhao delegation
is about to arrive

14:51.400 --> 14:53.800
and the alliance meeting with Great Zhao
is very important to His Majesty.

14:53.880 --> 14:56.720
I hope you won't let rumors affect you.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.640
Or it could bring trouble to your family

15:00.120 --> 15:01.400
if His Majesty pursues it.

15:06.640 --> 15:07.520
Mr. Shen,

15:08.800 --> 15:11.040
enough of such high-sounding rhetoric.

15:11.120 --> 15:14.000
Do you truly not know
where the rumors originated from?

15:14.560 --> 15:16.720
After you ignored my letter,

15:16.800 --> 15:18.920
you first sent me
to the Music Affairs Division,

15:19.760 --> 15:21.520
then you declined me before His Majesty.

15:22.080 --> 15:24.320
Even if I have the opportunity
to perform with Hanlin scholars,

15:24.400 --> 15:27.080
you kept asking them to brush me off,
humiliating me.

15:28.040 --> 15:30.560
If I don't resemble your late wife,

15:30.640 --> 15:32.040
would you still treat me this way?

15:32.560 --> 15:33.520
Ms. Jiang Li,

15:34.160 --> 15:35.560
this has nothing to do with your looks.

15:35.640 --> 15:36.560
If that's the case,

15:38.040 --> 15:39.240
why don't we

15:39.760 --> 15:42.400
perform together?

15:45.760 --> 15:46.600
What did you say?

15:46.680 --> 15:48.680
The best way to dispel rumors

15:48.760 --> 15:50.040
is to confront them directly.

15:51.760 --> 15:53.440
If, as you say,

15:53.520 --> 15:55.120
it has nothing to do with my appearance,

15:55.680 --> 15:58.080
then our performance together
would be the best proof.

15:58.640 --> 16:01.560
It'll prove that you can distinguish
between me and your late wife,

16:01.640 --> 16:04.280
that you aren't deliberately avoiding me,

16:04.360 --> 16:06.800
and that we have a clear conscience.

16:09.840 --> 16:12.360
Mr. Shen, you're indeed scared.

16:17.320 --> 16:18.400
I'm very curious

16:19.520 --> 16:25.200
whether you love or hate your late wife.

16:27.600 --> 16:28.800
You must hate her.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.320
Because I resemble her,

16:30.400 --> 16:32.080
you've projected your hatred

16:32.160 --> 16:33.680
toward your late wife onto me,

16:33.760 --> 16:35.720
targeting me and avoiding me
in any possible way.

16:36.280 --> 16:38.000
You two weren't the loving couple

16:38.080 --> 16:39.480
like people say.

16:39.560 --> 16:40.520
You hate her.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.280
Stop it!

16:53.680 --> 16:54.680
I'm sorry,

16:54.760 --> 16:55.640
Mr. Shen.

16:57.160 --> 16:59.200
I must have been deeply hurt by the rumors

16:59.280 --> 17:00.520
to ask such questions.

17:01.640 --> 17:02.760
I have crossed the line.

17:07.760 --> 17:08.800
I'm going back inside.

17:17.760 --> 17:18.599
I love her.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.240
Mr. Shen, what did you say?

17:36.280 --> 17:37.160
I love her.

17:43.000 --> 17:45.000
I'm sure your late wife

17:46.280 --> 17:47.720
would be very happy to hear that.

17:48.280 --> 17:51.040
From now on,
come to the Hanlin Academy daily at 3 p.m.

17:52.840 --> 17:53.840
I'll perform with you.

18:21.280 --> 18:22.520
Have you hidden Chu Lan well?

18:22.600 --> 18:23.680
Father, don't worry.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.680
I've arranged for him to stay
at the Palace Security Office.

18:25.760 --> 18:27.000
The security is tight there,

18:27.080 --> 18:29.640
so even Xiao Heng's people can't get in.

18:29.720 --> 18:32.080
It took me considerable effort
to win over Yuan Jiang,

18:32.160 --> 18:34.680
the Commissioner
of the Palace Security Office.

18:34.760 --> 18:36.880
Don't mess things up for me.

18:36.960 --> 18:38.360
Don't worry, Father.

18:39.560 --> 18:41.080
Yuan Jiang only
pledged allegiance recently.

18:41.160 --> 18:44.600
This is precisely the opportunity
for me to test their loyalty to you.

18:46.040 --> 18:47.040
Jin'er,

18:47.600 --> 18:49.120
be extra careful too.

18:51.120 --> 18:52.040
Yes.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.560
Are you all right?

19:05.640 --> 19:08.680
When you look at him,
I can see affection in your eyes.

19:08.760 --> 19:10.440
He isn't the person I love.

19:11.000 --> 19:12.000
I don't do romance.

19:13.520 --> 19:14.680
It's up to you to save me or not.

19:23.760 --> 19:24.920
You're both liars.

19:28.840 --> 19:30.400
We're both liars?

19:30.480 --> 19:31.680
What does that mean?

19:31.760 --> 19:32.600
Ignore her.

19:35.520 --> 19:36.760
What are you holding?

19:36.840 --> 19:39.000
This is the chrysanthemum tea
I dried myself.

19:40.120 --> 19:40.960
It dispels heat.

19:42.680 --> 19:43.800
Wen Ji.

19:45.800 --> 19:47.080
Brew some and give it to Jiuyue.

19:47.800 --> 19:49.920
This isn't about pacifying her.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.200
It's a jealousy issue.

19:53.040 --> 19:53.880
Go find Lu Ji.

19:53.960 --> 19:55.280
Twenty canes, right?

19:56.000 --> 19:57.720
Even 200 canes
won't alleviate this jealousy!

20:00.640 --> 20:02.920
Have those who attempted
to assassinate Jiuyue been caught?

20:03.000 --> 20:03.880
We're on it.

20:04.760 --> 20:05.600
What about you?

20:06.360 --> 20:07.800
Is everything going as planned?

20:07.880 --> 20:08.960
It's almost time for harvest.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.960
I heard you're playing
the guqin for Shen Yurong.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.840
Duke Su, I thought
you didn't like to probe.

20:13.920 --> 20:16.200
Why do you monitor my every step?

20:16.680 --> 20:17.800
I don't even need to probe.

20:18.960 --> 20:20.560
Once I hear about it,

20:20.640 --> 20:21.920
it feels unsettling.

20:22.000 --> 20:24.160
Then next time,
I'll bring some mandarin peels.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.440
What does that mean?

20:25.520 --> 20:26.520
To alleviate jealousy.

20:28.800 --> 20:29.920
You're actually planning

20:30.000 --> 20:31.440
to perform together with Jiang Li?

20:32.040 --> 20:33.880
What are you thinking?
Do you have a death wish?

20:34.480 --> 20:36.160
What if Her Highness finds out?

20:36.240 --> 20:37.760
Do you want our entire family to die?

20:39.520 --> 20:42.760
Keeping the most dangerous person close
is the safest.

20:46.520 --> 20:47.400
Son,

20:47.480 --> 20:49.640
are you still in love with Xue Fangfei?

20:50.520 --> 20:51.560
Don't forget

20:52.040 --> 20:54.000
that Jiang Li and Xue Fangfei are enemies

20:54.080 --> 20:55.640
of Her Highness.

20:55.720 --> 20:57.040
If you don't distance yourself

20:57.120 --> 20:58.160
and actively get involved,

20:58.640 --> 21:00.080
what would Her Highness think?

21:00.160 --> 21:01.360
Mother, don't worry.

21:02.120 --> 21:03.640
I know what I'm doing.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.480
Your Highness.

21:31.640 --> 21:33.160
They're really rehearsing together?

21:33.240 --> 21:34.480
These few days,

21:34.560 --> 21:36.480
they've been rehearsing together
at Hanlin Academy.

21:38.280 --> 21:39.880
Do you want Mr. Shen to come over?

21:41.440 --> 21:42.360
No need.

21:43.280 --> 21:45.000
It's useless to say certain things.

21:46.440 --> 21:48.280
He needs to see it with his own eyes

21:48.360 --> 21:49.960
to understand what he should not do.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.240
Who is he?

24:06.320 --> 24:07.600
A servant of the Jiang family.

24:07.680 --> 24:08.600
Luckily, he was around.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.640
I thought you'd be curious

24:13.360 --> 24:15.000
about who wanted to kill me first.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.840
The authorities will investigate clearly.

24:26.240 --> 24:28.400
He didn't stab hard
and the injury isn't severe.

24:28.480 --> 24:29.320
Come with me.

24:29.840 --> 24:31.240
A thief got into the Hanlin Academy.

24:31.320 --> 24:32.560
I'll have someone escort you home.

24:38.280 --> 24:39.320
That person's Qinggong is great.

24:39.400 --> 24:40.720
I chased him for several streets,

24:41.560 --> 24:42.560
but still lost him.

24:43.120 --> 24:45.280
Do you think Shen Yurong sent

24:45.360 --> 24:47.240
the assassin today?

24:47.320 --> 24:48.960
It seems like the assassin

24:49.040 --> 24:50.760
stabbed Shen Yurong viciously.

24:50.840 --> 24:52.400
Had he not restrained his force in time,

24:52.480 --> 24:53.800
it might have pierced his chest

24:54.600 --> 24:55.600
and killed him.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.240
So it was

24:58.040 --> 24:59.200
Wanning's men.

24:59.800 --> 25:00.760
What a pity.

25:01.760 --> 25:03.440
He would've been
a great witness and evidence.

25:04.480 --> 25:06.000
So this was your plan all along.

25:10.320 --> 25:11.200
Did you…

25:13.280 --> 25:14.120
fly here?

25:14.200 --> 25:15.480
Obviously.

25:19.720 --> 25:21.880
Initially, you said
you're approaching Shen Yurong

25:21.960 --> 25:23.480
just to get evidence against him.

25:24.040 --> 25:25.320
It seems like

25:25.400 --> 25:27.280
that's not all you want.

25:27.760 --> 25:29.920
You even want to use this
to provoke Wanning.

25:30.000 --> 25:32.080
The evidence
against Shen Yurong is Wanning.

25:32.160 --> 25:34.520
I told you not to get yourself
involved in the scheme.

25:34.600 --> 25:36.320
Did you not remember a single word?

25:39.240 --> 25:41.400
Zhao Ke is secretly protecting me.

25:42.280 --> 25:43.280
And I

25:44.000 --> 25:46.200
trust the man you sent

25:46.280 --> 25:47.720
will protect me.

25:47.800 --> 25:49.080
Don't flatter me.

25:53.480 --> 25:55.640
If Zhao Ke couldn't stop
the assassin today

25:55.720 --> 25:56.760
and if you…

25:59.760 --> 26:00.800
What would you do?

26:01.280 --> 26:04.000
While getting involved directly
may not be the best strategy,

26:05.280 --> 26:06.680
given the current circumstances,

26:06.760 --> 26:08.280
I have no choice but to do it this way.

26:09.120 --> 26:10.680
I just didn't expect Wanning

26:10.760 --> 26:12.440
to directly send someone to kill me.

26:12.520 --> 26:15.240
She ended up taking this step
because of this man.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.480
Don't change the subject.

26:16.560 --> 26:18.200
I don't care about Wanning.

26:18.280 --> 26:19.160
I know.

26:20.520 --> 26:21.560
You care about me.

26:23.600 --> 26:24.680
Rest assured,

26:24.760 --> 26:26.360
getting involved directly

26:26.440 --> 26:27.560
will bring success this time.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.800
I promise I won't do it again.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.280
You're eloquent.

26:35.760 --> 26:37.760
Then decline the performance
with Shen Yurong tomorrow.

26:38.520 --> 26:40.960
- Shen Yurong took a stab for me today.
- Was that an act?

26:41.040 --> 26:42.480
- It was true.
- So?

26:42.560 --> 26:44.400
So I'm thinking
maybe I can take a different approach.

26:49.840 --> 26:52.080
Is this approach still going
to get yourself involved?

26:53.080 --> 26:54.440
Not this time.

26:55.280 --> 26:56.360
Duke Su,

26:56.440 --> 26:58.680
please trust me

26:58.760 --> 27:00.080
like how I trust you.

27:07.560 --> 27:08.800
GAZEBO

27:13.480 --> 27:15.360
Yurong,

27:15.440 --> 27:17.240
you've become impressive.

27:18.440 --> 27:19.960
Not only did you take a stab for her,

27:21.000 --> 27:24.240
but after recognizing my man,

27:24.800 --> 27:26.560
you also dared to protect her.

27:26.640 --> 27:28.760
If Your Highness kills someone
at Hanlin Academy's gate,

27:29.320 --> 27:31.240
I, the one in charge
of the book compilation,

27:31.320 --> 27:32.600
will be taken away
for questioning tomorrow.

27:32.680 --> 27:34.160
I guess

27:34.240 --> 27:35.760
it's my fault then.

27:35.840 --> 27:37.360
I just want to remind Your Highness

27:38.600 --> 27:40.040
that if you want to kill her again,

27:41.040 --> 27:42.560
don't involve me.

27:42.640 --> 27:44.000
Why are you playing dumb?

27:44.480 --> 27:46.200
Xiao Heng is by her side.

27:46.760 --> 27:49.520
As I missed this chance to kill her,
I won't get another one.

27:50.480 --> 27:51.320
Actually,

27:52.120 --> 27:53.560
you were the one who made me angry.

27:54.840 --> 27:56.600
Why didn't you inform me

27:57.520 --> 27:59.000
before performing a song with her?

27:59.560 --> 28:01.680
No one in Hanlin Academy
wants to perform with her.

28:02.560 --> 28:04.320
This is a task entrusted to me
by His Majesty.

28:04.840 --> 28:05.840
If I don't handle it well,

28:06.520 --> 28:07.800
I will definitely be punished.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.120
With me around,

28:09.680 --> 28:10.720
who would dare to punish you?

28:10.800 --> 28:12.160
This matter concerns state affairs.

28:12.240 --> 28:14.520
I don't want to be someone
who relies on Your Highness.

28:16.440 --> 28:18.520
If I were that way,
you wouldn't like me too.

28:19.280 --> 28:20.400
Besides,

28:20.480 --> 28:22.200
I have moved on

28:22.280 --> 28:23.520
and have a clear conscience.

28:23.600 --> 28:25.600
That's why I dare
to perform with Jiang Li.

28:25.680 --> 28:28.440
Avoidance is a sign
of a guilty conscience.

28:28.520 --> 28:32.200
You really have a way with words,

28:32.760 --> 28:34.320
but you'd better speak the truth,

28:34.840 --> 28:38.400
or you know my personality.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.520
I dare not lie to you, Your Highness.

28:47.120 --> 28:48.320
In that case,

28:49.280 --> 28:51.800
focus on your state affairs

28:51.880 --> 28:57.080
and let me see
your so-called clear conscience.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.600
When I'm not grounded anymore,

29:00.240 --> 29:02.040
I will go meet her properly.

29:07.280 --> 29:09.760
A few days ago, thieves broke
into the Hanlin Academy.

29:10.320 --> 29:12.480
We've already found out
that they're bandits on the run.

29:13.040 --> 29:15.120
Everyone should be cautious.

29:15.720 --> 29:18.440
Tomorrow is the day the Zhao delegation
enters the capital.

29:18.520 --> 29:21.480
It's a critical time,
so everyone must not slack off.

29:21.560 --> 29:22.720
Give your full effort.

29:22.800 --> 29:23.840
After everything goes smoothly,

29:23.920 --> 29:26.120
not only will everyone
receive rewards from His Majesty,

29:26.200 --> 29:29.280
but I'll also host a banquet
at home to reward everyone

29:29.360 --> 29:30.680
and thank you for your hard work.

29:30.760 --> 29:32.760
- Thank you, Mr. Shen.
- Thank you, Mr. Shen.

29:32.840 --> 29:33.920
Prepare accordingly.

29:34.000 --> 29:36.000
- We're going to be busy these days.
- Yes, let's go.

29:36.080 --> 29:37.040
I'll go with you.

29:38.720 --> 29:41.000
Jiang Li, when everything's done,

29:41.080 --> 29:42.240
let's drink.

29:42.320 --> 29:44.200
Yes, we haven't gathered in ages.

29:44.280 --> 29:45.200
Sure.

29:45.280 --> 29:46.200
We'll go ahead.

29:46.280 --> 29:48.480
- There are still many things to do.
- Go.

29:48.560 --> 29:49.560
- Let's go.
- All right.

29:50.880 --> 29:51.720
Jiang Li.

29:51.800 --> 29:52.680
Jiang Li.

29:57.320 --> 29:58.280
Let me tell you,

29:58.960 --> 30:01.040
these days have passed so quickly.

30:01.120 --> 30:02.360
I haven't had enough yet.

30:02.440 --> 30:04.760
What's the matter? Have you become
addicted to receiving gifts?

30:04.840 --> 30:07.040
She loves the things that you gave her.

30:07.120 --> 30:08.600
Lately, she has been smiling
at me a lot more.

30:09.280 --> 30:10.200
But honestly,

30:10.280 --> 30:12.360
as long as I receive
the gifts accordingly,

30:12.440 --> 30:13.920
I can continue to help you.

30:14.000 --> 30:14.920
All right.

30:15.000 --> 30:16.280
Jiang Li.

30:16.360 --> 30:17.200
I'll go ahead then.

30:17.280 --> 30:18.120
All right.

30:19.600 --> 30:20.640
Shijie.

30:21.320 --> 30:22.320
I heard that since no one

30:22.400 --> 30:24.040
at the Hanlin Academy
wants to perform with you,

30:24.120 --> 30:25.840
you have to perform with Mr. Shen.

30:25.920 --> 30:28.200
But there seems to be no conflict

30:28.280 --> 30:29.240
between you and Zhao Qi.

30:29.720 --> 30:32.840
Mr. Shen's talent is unmatched
at the Hanlin Academy.

30:33.560 --> 30:35.200
Performing with him is naturally the best.

30:37.240 --> 30:38.640
I'm going to rehearse now.

30:48.560 --> 30:50.160
Your Majesty, the Ministry of Rites

30:50.240 --> 30:52.160
has already prepared everything to welcome

30:52.240 --> 30:53.400
the Zhao delegation.

30:53.480 --> 30:54.480
Today, the Court
of State Ceremonial's Minister

30:54.560 --> 30:55.640
will personally welcome
the delegation into the city

30:56.360 --> 30:57.400
and bring them to the official guesthouse.

30:57.480 --> 31:00.600
After resting and settling in, they will
enter the palace for the banquet.

31:00.680 --> 31:01.680
Thank you, Minister Shen.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.400
Have you captured Chu Lan?

31:33.040 --> 31:34.440
He should be
at the Palace Security Office.

31:34.520 --> 31:35.760
Palace Security Office?

31:36.480 --> 31:38.240
Have they also sided with Li Zhongnan?

31:39.320 --> 31:40.360
How is Great Zhao's princess?

31:40.440 --> 31:41.960
She is recuperating in my residence.

31:42.040 --> 31:44.840
We'll suffer a drawback if this goes on.

31:45.360 --> 31:46.520
That's what I'm worried about too.

31:47.000 --> 31:48.360
We're having the alliance meeting soon

31:48.440 --> 31:50.040
and Jiuyue is severely injured.

31:50.120 --> 31:51.560
With the assassin still at large,

31:52.120 --> 31:54.240
Great Zhao is bound
to doubt our sincerity.

31:54.320 --> 31:57.200
If Prince Cheng rises in rebellion
someday, it will be another variable.

31:57.280 --> 31:59.760
Let's use this chance to get rid
of the Palace Security Office then.

32:00.240 --> 32:02.640
How can I allow my city gates
to be controlled by Prince Cheng?

32:02.720 --> 32:04.000
My secret guards alone

32:04.480 --> 32:05.960
can't get rid
of the Palace Security Office.

32:06.040 --> 32:07.000
What do you want to do?

32:07.080 --> 32:08.280
I want the Longwu Army.

32:08.360 --> 32:09.440
The Longwu Army?

32:13.400 --> 32:15.000
After training them secretly for so long,

32:15.480 --> 32:16.640
do you want to expose them now?

32:16.720 --> 32:18.600
Since they have already set up the stage,

32:19.320 --> 32:21.480
why don't we put on a good show

32:21.560 --> 32:23.000
as a deliberate act to warn them?

32:28.840 --> 32:29.760
Remember,

32:29.840 --> 32:32.080
city defense is crucial
for the stability of the capital.

32:32.600 --> 32:35.240
Please always remember your mission.
Do you understand?

32:35.320 --> 32:36.880
I'll complete the mission successfully.

32:36.960 --> 32:38.240
Very good.

32:38.320 --> 32:39.160
Chancellor Li.

32:39.680 --> 32:42.800
How did you find the time to come
to the Palace Security Office, Duke Su?

32:42.880 --> 32:43.840
I received intelligence

32:44.320 --> 32:47.400
that an assassin
from the north is hiding here.

32:47.480 --> 32:49.640
Duke Su, do you have any evidence?

32:49.720 --> 32:53.560
Chancellor Li, my specialty
lies in intelligence gathering.

32:54.120 --> 32:55.800
The evidence is
in the Palace Security Office.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.840
We'll know after I investigate.

32:59.200 --> 33:00.040
Guards!

33:06.840 --> 33:09.760
Duke Su, the Palace Security Office
is not a place to be messed with.

33:09.840 --> 33:11.800
Your display of power

33:11.880 --> 33:13.840
might not work effectively here.

33:24.880 --> 33:27.640
By order of His Majesty,
the Longwu Army is conducting a search

33:27.720 --> 33:30.040
of the Palace Security Office.
General Yuan, please open the gates.

33:30.120 --> 33:32.520
If it is an imperial order,
where is the decree?

33:32.600 --> 33:34.280
General Yuan, you seem to be confused.

33:34.360 --> 33:37.760
The Longwu Army has the privilege
to act first and report later.

33:41.520 --> 33:43.840
Xiao Heng,
the Palace Security Office's guards

33:43.920 --> 33:45.800
protect the capital's gates.
It's different from anywhere else.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.800
Please bring the decree with you, Duke Su.

33:47.880 --> 33:49.040
Search the place.

33:49.120 --> 33:52.720
Kill anyone who dares to stop you.

33:52.800 --> 33:54.080
- Search the place!
- Yes!

33:58.720 --> 34:02.360
Chancellor Li, you should stay away.
Weapons are dangerous.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.720
They might accidentally

34:04.400 --> 34:06.320
kill you first and report later.

34:06.400 --> 34:10.120
Duke Su, have you considered
the consequences?

34:10.199 --> 34:11.840
When the flood irrigates the fields,

34:12.480 --> 34:14.280
don't let the mice escape.

34:14.360 --> 34:15.199
- Yes.
- Yes.

34:47.679 --> 34:48.719
How dare you come here?

34:48.800 --> 34:52.040
This time, you can't escape.
I brought my sidekick along.

34:52.719 --> 34:53.960
He's a ruthless, not talkative,

34:54.040 --> 34:56.000
and specializes in dealing
with defeated enemies.

34:56.080 --> 34:57.080
Get them!

35:20.280 --> 35:22.640
Prince Cheng's subordinate got away again.

35:22.720 --> 35:24.520
The relationship
between Prince Cheng and Chu Lan

35:24.600 --> 35:26.120
is akin to yours and mine.

35:26.200 --> 35:27.040
It won't be easy to catch him.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.680
We can take this opportunity

35:28.760 --> 35:30.760
to replace everyone
in the Palace Security Office.

35:31.640 --> 35:32.840
I didn't hold back yesterday.

35:32.920 --> 35:34.800
Quite a number of people
must recuperate at home.

35:38.720 --> 35:41.400
Because of this incident,
many people want to impeach you.

35:43.680 --> 35:45.200
Yuan Jiang harbored a fugitive

35:45.280 --> 35:47.360
and even allowed his subordinates
to release Chu Lan.

35:48.040 --> 35:50.200
This crime alone
is enough to silence people.

35:50.280 --> 35:53.240
He's quite clever. He found
a subordinate to take the blame

35:53.320 --> 35:54.480
and resigned from his post.

35:54.560 --> 35:55.800
Do you want me to interrogate him?

35:55.880 --> 35:57.040
With foreign envoys in the capital,

35:57.120 --> 35:58.720
it's not the time
to handle internal cases.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.280
Reclaiming control
of the Palace Security Office

36:00.360 --> 36:02.520
has already neutralized
one of Prince Cheng's moves.

36:02.600 --> 36:05.720
We'll settle the scores with Yuan Jiang
and Li Zhongnan in due time.

36:05.800 --> 36:11.440
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

36:16.040 --> 36:16.920
Father.

36:17.000 --> 36:19.640
Who leaked the news that Chu Lan
is in the Palace Security Office?

36:19.720 --> 36:21.160
I have no idea.

36:21.240 --> 36:23.080
The Palace Security Office
is heavily guarded.

36:23.160 --> 36:24.040
Besides them,

36:24.120 --> 36:25.600
only the three of us knew about this.

36:25.680 --> 36:28.400
- Could Chu Lan have leaked it himself?
- Father.

36:28.480 --> 36:31.280
If it wasn't him,
then it must be one of us.

36:31.360 --> 36:33.400
It's either me or you!

36:33.480 --> 36:34.400
Father.

36:37.360 --> 36:38.520
It's Xiao Heng.

36:38.600 --> 36:40.120
I find it hard to swallow the fact

36:40.200 --> 36:41.960
that Xiao Heng repeatedly sabotaged
our major plans.

36:42.040 --> 36:43.840
Those in the Palace Security Office
are not to be trifled with.

36:43.920 --> 36:45.600
How many secret guards
can Xiao Heng possibly have?

36:45.680 --> 36:47.200
They wouldn't be Yuan Jiang's match,

36:47.280 --> 36:49.320
which was why I used Chu Lan as bait

36:49.400 --> 36:50.560
to lure him over.

36:50.640 --> 36:53.440
It also gave me a chance to test
the Palace Security Office's loyalty.

36:53.960 --> 36:55.200
But I never expected

36:55.280 --> 36:57.080
that Xiao Heng
would bring the Longwu Army.

36:57.640 --> 36:59.200
Father, it's my negligence

36:59.280 --> 37:00.160
and my mistake.

37:00.240 --> 37:01.880
- Please punish me.
- Fool!

37:03.120 --> 37:05.760
- Father.
- What a fool who dared to act on your own.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.960
You ruined the pawns
I painstakingly laid out

37:09.040 --> 37:10.960
before they could even be put into use!

37:11.840 --> 37:14.240
Now that the Palace Security Office
is out of our control,

37:15.200 --> 37:16.960
how can we turn the tide?

37:19.360 --> 37:21.960
Father, give me another chance.

37:22.040 --> 37:23.600
I won't fail this time.

37:23.680 --> 37:25.760
You incompetent fool.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.160
You won't get another chance.

37:29.000 --> 37:29.840
Father!

37:30.480 --> 37:31.360
Father!

38:06.840 --> 38:08.120
LIANGDU GUESTHOUSE

38:08.200 --> 38:10.480
- Welcome, Emperor of Great Zhao!
- Welcome, Emperor of Great Zhao!

38:11.160 --> 38:12.400
GREAT ZHAO EMPEROR

38:12.480 --> 38:14.280
Welcome to our nation,
Emperor of Great Zhao.

38:14.360 --> 38:16.120
Our emperor ordered Duke Su

38:16.200 --> 38:18.680
to lead our officials and scholars
to greet you.

38:19.240 --> 38:21.200
I am Xiao Heng, Duke Su of Great Yan.

38:21.280 --> 38:22.240
Greetings, Your Majesty.

38:22.320 --> 38:24.600
Please rest in this guesthouse today

38:24.680 --> 38:25.720
and enter the palace tomorrow.

38:26.400 --> 38:28.080
The gracious hospitality
of Great Yan's Emperor

38:28.600 --> 38:30.320
is deeply appreciated.

38:31.840 --> 38:34.760
Duke Su, is my sister inside?

38:36.640 --> 38:37.680
Jiuyue!

38:43.240 --> 38:44.120
Brother!

38:48.640 --> 38:49.600
I'm here.

38:54.160 --> 38:56.600
I heard you got injured.
Are you all right?

38:58.120 --> 38:59.360
Did they catch the culprit?

38:59.880 --> 39:00.840
Who did this?

39:01.760 --> 39:03.320
Thanks to Duke Su's help,

39:03.880 --> 39:04.800
I'm fine.

39:05.400 --> 39:07.040
Duke Su is still investigating the matter.

39:07.120 --> 39:09.720
Don't blame him.

39:09.800 --> 39:11.440
Since you trust Duke Su this much,

39:12.040 --> 39:13.600
I won't pursue the matter.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.800
However, please give me an explanation

39:16.880 --> 39:18.720
in the future, Duke Su.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.640
Of course.

39:20.720 --> 39:21.920
This way, please, Your Majesty.

39:22.000 --> 39:27.200
LIANGDU GUESTHOUSE

39:27.280 --> 39:30.320
HENING GATE

39:30.400 --> 39:33.520
HEAVEN'S AUSPICIOUS RESPONSE
TO MONARCH'S HIGH VIRTUE

39:53.400 --> 39:54.520
Your Majesty.

39:55.640 --> 39:56.880
Thank you, Great Yan,

39:56.960 --> 39:59.280
for the meticulously
prepared collection of classics

39:59.880 --> 40:01.600
and this splendid banquet.

40:02.280 --> 40:05.360
It allowed us to experience
Great Yan's inclusive spirit.

40:07.200 --> 40:08.840
I am especially grateful to Your Majesty

40:13.480 --> 40:15.600
for helping me find my long-lost sister.

40:17.040 --> 40:21.320
May Great Zhao and Great Yan
establish everlasting friendship

40:21.400 --> 40:22.560
and form an enduring alliance.

40:22.640 --> 40:25.080
Your reunion with the princess

40:25.160 --> 40:26.400
is a fortunate event for us.

40:50.760 --> 40:54.640
Suddenly hearing that immortals
had arrived in Penglai,

40:55.160 --> 40:59.960
I suspect it might be an old friend
descending from the heavens.

41:00.040 --> 41:04.440
At sunrise, memories of youth come
flooding back while riding a boat.

41:04.960 --> 41:08.920
At night, longing ages the soul.

41:09.000 --> 41:12.120
The emperor's Imperial Court
welcomes guests.

41:12.200 --> 41:16.720
Countless spring flowers
laugh with the wind.

41:16.800 --> 41:21.280
Talking about good wine,
we get drunk again.

41:23.080 --> 41:27.440
Stars scattered across the sky,
tears flowing like tides.

41:27.520 --> 41:32.600
Who says the mortal world
is full of loneliness?

41:33.320 --> 41:34.920
Bottoms up,

41:35.000 --> 41:41.520
the mountains and rivers
stretch endlessly.

42:28.480 --> 42:31.240
HEAVEN'S AUSPICIOUS RESPONSE
TO MONARCH'S HIGH VIRTUE

43:33.920 --> 43:36.080
Today, I will escort
the Emperor of Great Zhao and Jiuyue

43:36.160 --> 43:37.040
to the border.

43:37.760 --> 43:38.760
When will you be back?

43:41.280 --> 43:42.120
I'm not sure.

43:47.200 --> 43:49.960
What do you think of the music
I played yesterday?

43:51.040 --> 43:52.160
It was extremely unpleasant.

43:54.400 --> 43:57.120
I also feel it was
the most unpleasant performance

43:57.200 --> 44:00.160
I've ever delivered in my life.

44:00.240 --> 44:03.120
Next time, I'll play a different piece
for you, all right?

44:05.040 --> 44:06.200
I'll remember that.

44:07.920 --> 44:09.080
Don't go back on your word.

44:11.200 --> 44:12.080
I won't.

44:12.880 --> 44:15.040
Duke Su, you should leave and return soon

44:15.120 --> 44:16.320
so I can repay my debt earlier.

44:19.760 --> 44:22.360
Before leaving,
I have a piece of advice for you.

44:23.360 --> 44:24.240
What is it?

44:24.920 --> 44:28.000
Be it the previous life or the current,
just live to the fullest.

44:29.240 --> 44:31.200
Never compromise yourself

44:31.280 --> 44:33.360
to become someone else
just to please others,

44:35.200 --> 44:38.480
including me.

44:50.240 --> 44:57.080
RETURN OF THE CLOUDS
